WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:02.935
Meet Giuseppe, in ninety seconds.

00:04.274 --> 00:05.267
Five years.

00:05.297 --> 00:06.311
Three campuses.

00:06.341 --> 00:07.354
Two languages.

00:07.384 --> 00:08.497
One direction.

00:08.648 --> 00:14.026
Giuseppe Matrisciano: an Italian marketing graduate student in Miami.

00:15.009 --> 00:20.409
He helps brands connect with younger audiences, through storytelling and consumer insight.

00:21.270 --> 00:24.113
From Bologna to Miami, in five years.

00:25.323 --> 00:29.368
It starts in Bologna: born and raised under the porticoes.

00:29.617 --> 00:35.520
Clearwater, Florida. A new country, a new language, an associate degree with straight A's.

00:35.878 --> 00:41.605
Athens, Georgia. A degree in consumer economics at the University of Georgia.

00:42.139 --> 00:50.080
And now Miami: a master's in marketing at the University of Miami, on a forty thousand dollar merit scholarship.

00:50.207 --> 00:52.091
Three claims. Each with proof.

00:52.574 --> 00:55.430
Thirteen graphics for a live student podcast.

00:56.698 --> 01:00.653
Six hundred thirty surveys. One stereotype, retired.

01:00.922 --> 01:04.577
An eighteen hundred dollar campaign plan, for RIMOWA.

01:05.246 --> 01:06.233
And next?

01:07.003 --> 01:10.436
A digital marketing manager, in tech or luxury.

01:11.857 --> 01:14.623
Connecting people, through creative marketing.

01:17.437 --> 01:23.047
He's looking for internships and entry-level roles in digital marketing and brand strategy.

01:23.077 --> 01:24.219
Let's connect.

